Modifications made to the original template
-------------------------------------------

- Content, branding and layout adapted for Hayot Dried Fruit and Spices LLC,
  with English (en), Russian (ru) and Uzbek (uz) versions of the pages.
- Images in img/ recompressed in place (same file names): long edge capped,
  JPEG quality reduced, metadata stripped; no references changed.
- Root-absolute paths (href="/..." and src="/...") converted to relative paths
  so the site works when served from a subpath (GitHub Pages project site).
  Broken relative paths in pages/*.html and Russian page image references
  were corrected.
- The <html lang> attribute set per language (en, ru, uz).
- Accessibility improvements: aria-label on icon-only links and buttons,
  descriptive alt text for images, aria-current on active navigation links,
  accessible language switcher, labels for inputs, loading="lazy" and
  decoding="async" on below-the-fold images.
- css/style.css: added visible :focus-visible outlines and a
  prefers-reduced-motion block.
- js/main.js: respects prefers-reduced-motion (no carousel autoplay, no animated
  scroll) and adds accessible names to the carousel navigation buttons.
- Footer credit "Designed by HTML Codex" added to every page that has a footer.
